WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:06.510
"Let's go to the art museum," Aunt Judy said.

2
00:00:06.511 --> 00:00:12.425
"They're having a treasure hunt."

3
00:00:12.426 --> 00:00:17.826
At the museum the kids got maps and lists.

4
00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:22.646
"Try to find everything on the list," Aunt Judy said.

5
00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:26.649
She went to look at her favorite paintings.

6
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.486
Oliver and Harry worked together.

7
00:00:30.487 --> 00:00:34.502
Emmy searched on her own.

8
00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:36.790
"Here's the first item.

9
00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:41.286
A painting of a boy and his dog."

10
00:00:41.287 --> 00:00:44.447
Harry sent her a text.

11
00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:49.624
I can't find anything, and I lost Oliver!

12
00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:53.498
Emmy saw Oliver in the next room.

13
00:00:53.499 --> 00:01:00.468
She texted Harry. I found Oliver.

14
00:01:00.469 --> 00:01:04.531
Let's meet at the stairs and work together.

15
00:01:04.532 --> 00:01:10.199
Oliver spotted another item above the stairs.

16
00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:19.173
"There's the mobile!" he said.

17
00:01:19.174 --> 00:01:24.365
Later Emmy stared at the list.

18
00:01:24.366 --> 00:01:29.956
"We need three more things."

19
00:01:29.957 --> 00:01:33.670
She found the statue of a dancer.

20
00:01:33.671 --> 00:01:40.161
Oliver found the bed in another room.

21
00:01:40.162 --> 00:01:45.600
"I still can't find anything!" Harry said.

22
00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:49.443
Emmy looked at the list again.

23
00:01:49.444 --> 00:01:54.923
"We need to find something a horse wears," she said.

24
00:01:54.924 --> 00:01:59.684
"What's that?"

25
00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:07.018
"I know!" Harry led them to a large room.

26
00:02:07.019 --> 00:02:12.769
"Look at the knights in armor," Oliver said.

27
00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:19.879
"That horse is wearing armor too," Harry said.

28
00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.649
"We're finished!" Oliver said.

29
00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:29.193
Emmy smiled. "Not yet.

30
00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:34.608
Now we have to find Aunt Judy!"

